// 590) ༄//
'khor ba thog mtha' med pas mi dmigs par bsngo ba gdams pa// yang 'di skad bdag gi thos pa dus gcig na/ stod lung pa gnas brtan gyis g.yang gzar ba rtswa ri 'dra la/ ga tho mu ther btang ba snyan par byung bas 'di la ngas dge 'dun la ngo sprod zhig byed na/ sngon 'phags pa gro zhun skyes rna ba bye ba ri bya ba pha phyug pas bang ba byed pa nyi shu yod pa zhig la bud med nas glu longs byas pas bud med zhig la bu zhig skar ma gro zhun la skyes pa dang*/ khyod rang rgyal po'i khab na yod pa la bang chen btang nas bu yod zhes pas lan bzhi'i bar du bu yod dam zer/ de ma rigs nas kha rog bsdad pa la khyod kyi bu yod bya ba lan du byas pas kha gser phyes 'gengs pa yin pa la/ de lan gsum du bgad zer te/ de nas bu des rab tu byung ba la drug sdes mar gsar gyi gong bu lta bu brtson 'grus dang brtul zhugs mi nus pa yang bstan pa la rab tu byung nas 'bras bu ni 'byin mi nus zhes pas/ kho khe grags skyes nas kun dga' bo la gdams pa zhus nas dur khrod du phyin nas 'chags byas te sa'i steng du rdo gcal byas nas de'i steng du 'gro ba 'chag pa 'ba' zhig gis 'bad pa byas pas ting nge 'dzin gcig kyang ma skyes pas yid mug te babs snyam pa dang*/ sangs rgyas kyis mkhyen nas gro zhun skyes 'dir shog sngon gyi pi wang sbreng shes sam shes na/ rgyud grims pa las skad 'byung ngam mi 'byung*/ lhod pa las 'byung ngam mi 'byung*/ ran pa ma bcos pa las 'byung ba de bzhin du sangs rgyas kyi chos thams cad kyang de ltar ro//
zhes gsungs pas kho dgra bcom pa thob ste/ 'di sngon nas rang bshad pas sgom shes pa mang po 'byung ba yin te skyes bu kun lhug pa de las 'byung ba yin/ des na 'dul ba'i don thams cad dbu ma ston pa yin te spros pa'i mtha' brgyad dang bral ba'i 'phags lam brgyad pa ston pa yin/
